lf or your team on a recurring schedule.","templates.automation_dashboard.create-report":"Create report","templates.automation_dashboard.current-estimated-monthly-runs":"Current estimated monthly runs: {number}","templates.automation_dashboard.date-last-modified":"Date last modified: {date}","templates.automation_dashboard.delete":"Delete","templates.automation_dashboard.delete-automation":"Delete automation","templates.automation_dashboard.delete-automation-confirmation":"This action cannot be undone.","templates.automation_dashboard.delete-automation-description":"Deleting the automation removes it from all boards. To remove it only from the current board, disable the automation instead.","templates.automation_dashboard.delete-failure-flag":"Something went wrong while deleting the automation. Please try again later.","templates.automation_dashboard.delete-success-flag":"The automation was deleted.","templates.automation_dashboard.describe-an-automation":'Describe an automation, e.g. "move done cards to the Done list"',"templates.automation_dashboard.disable-all":"Disable all automations","templates.automation_dashboard.disable-all-automations":"Disable all automations in this library","templates.automation_dashboard.disable-all-failure-flag":"Something went wrong while disabling all automations in the library. Please try again later.","templates.automation_dashboard.disable-automation-failure-flag":"Something went wrong while disabling the automation. Please try again later.","templates.automation_dashboard.disabled":"Disabled","templates.automation_dashboard.discard-automation":"Discard","templates.automation_dashboard.discard-suggestion":"Discard suggestion","templates.automation_dashboard.discarding-a-suggestion":"Discarding a suggestion cannot be undone.","templates.automation_dashboard.due-date":"Due date","templates.automation_dashboard.edit":"Edit","templates.automation_dashboard.email-reports-have-moved":"Email reports have moved","templates.automation_dashboard.email-reports-have-moved-into-the-dashboard":"Email reports have moved into the dashboard. To create new a report, open the Reports screen here.","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.board-button.example-1":'<strong>Monday setup:</strong> Archive all cards in list "This Week", and move all cards in list "Last Week" to "This Week".',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.board-button.example-2":'<strong>Prioritize:</strong> Sort the cards in list "Doing" by custom field "Priority" descending.',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.board-button.example-3":'<strong>Shuffle pick:</strong> Move 2 random cards from list "Backlog" to list "Doing".',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.board-button.main-heading":"Make multiple board actions happen with a single button.","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.board-button.video-caption":"Watch a 65-second overview of rules","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.card-button.example-1":'<strong>Assign to me:</strong> join the card, add the "In progress" label, and add an empty "To do" checklist to the card.',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.card-button.example-2":'<strong>Completed:</strong> Move the card to the "Done" list and remove the card\'s due date.',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.card-button.example-3":'<strong>Send to review:</strong> Add a member, add the "For review" label, and post a comment that says "Ready for review!"',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.card-button.main-heading":"Add quick actions to your cards with a button.","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.card-button.video-caption":"Watch a 65-second overview of rules","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.due-date.example-1":'The moment a <strong>card is due</strong>, <strong>move the card to the top of list</strong> "To Do" and <strong>join the card</strong>.',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.due-date.example-2":"2 hours <strong>before a card is due</strong>, <strong>add the red label to the card</strong>.","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.due-date.example-3":'3 days <strong>after a card is due</strong>, <strong>post comment</strong> "@board This card was due 3 days ago"',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.due-date.main-heading":"Make things happen automatically based on a card's due date.","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.due-date.video-caption":"Watch a 90-second overview of rules","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.rules.example-1":'When a <strong>card is created in list</strong> "To Do" by me, <strong>add the "Steps" checklist</strong>.',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.rules.example-2":'When a <strong>card is moved to list</strong> "Done" by anyone, <strong>mark the due date as complete and remove all members from the card</strong>.',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.rules.example-3":'<strong>When I am added to a card, set the due date</strong> in 5 working days and <strong>post a comment</strong> saying "I got this!"',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.rules.main-heading":"Rules are simple: when one thing happens, another thing happens automatically","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.rules.video-caption":"Watch a 65-second overview of rules","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.scheduled.example-1":'Every day at 8:55am, <strong>sort the list</strong> "Backlog" by due date.',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.scheduled.example-2":'Every third Wednesday of the month, <strong>create a card called</strong> "Planning Meeting" to the list "To Do" and <strong>add member</strong> @JohnSmith to the card.',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.scheduled.example-3":'Every year on the 14th of February, <strong>create a list called</strong> "Valentine\'s Day Ideas".',"templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.scheduled.main-heading":"Make your schedule work for you with actions based on a schedule.","templates.automation_dashboard.empty-state.scheduled.video-caption":"Watch a 90-second overview of rules","templates.automation_dashboard.enable-all":"Enable all automations","templates.automation_dashboard.enable-all-automations":"Enable all automations in this library","templates.automation_dashboard.enable-all-failure-flag":"Something went wrong while enabling all automations in the library. Please try again later.","templates.automation_dashboard.enable-automation-failure-flag":"Something went wrong while enabling the automation. Please try again later.","templates.automation_dashboard.enable-on-board":"Enable on this board","templates.automation_dashboard.enabled":"Enabled","templates.automation_dashboard.enabled-boards":"Enabled boards","templates.automation_dashboard.examples":"Examples","templates.automation_dashboard.filter":"Filter","templates.automation_dashboard.filter-by-library":"Filter by library","templates.automation_dashboard.filter-logs":"Filter logs to only show warnings and errors","templates.automation_dashboard.generate-automation":"Generate automation","templates.automation_dashboard.guest-setting-message":"This setting can be changed only by members of the Workspace.","templates.automation_dashboard.help":"Help","templates.automation_dashboard.hide-this-automation":"Hide this automation on this board for me only","templates.automation_dashboard.ignore":"Ignore","templates.automation_dashboard.import-all-automations":"Import all automations in this library","templates.automation_dashboard.import-all-library-updates":"Import all library updates","templates.automation_dashboard.import-failure-flag":"Something went wrong while importing the library. Please try again later.","templates.automation_dashboard.import-library":"Import library","templates.automation_dashboard.importing-will-update":"Importing will update automations to match the latest library version. Your changes may be overwritten. <a>Learn more about importing libraries.</a>","templates.automation_das