pture everything, anywhere from email, Trello's mobile app, Slack, Microsoft Teams, and Trello's Chrome extension.","templates.new_user_onboarding.inbox-intro-description-2":"This is a space for you to <strong>add to-dos</strong> or <strong>import them</strong> from other apps.","templates.new_user_onboarding.inbox-intro-taco-title-3":"Hey, I'm Taco!","templates.new_user_onboarding.inbox-intro-title":"Welcome to Trello! Meet your <strong>Inbox</strong>","templates.new_user_onboarding.later-list-title":"Later","templates.new_user_onboarding.mark-task-complete-aria-label":"Mark this card complete ({cardName})","templates.new_user_onboarding.mark-task-complete-taco-title":"Roo!","templates.new_user_onboarding.mark-task-completed-title":"You're on your way to better productivity!","templates.new_user_onboarding.mark-task-taco-title":"Check it off!","templates.new_user_onboarding.mark-task-title":"You finished your first to-do, mark it complete!","templates.new_user_onboarding.next":"Next","templates.new_user_onboarding.onboarding-page-title":"Get started with Trello","templates.new_user_onboarding.onboarding-progress":"Onboarding progress","templates.new_user_onboarding.one-last-thing":"One last thing!","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-card-description":"**{heading}**\n\n{body1}\n\n{body2}\n\n**{body3}**\n\n[{linkText}]({linkUrl})\n\n{body4}","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-card-description-body-1":"Forward any email, or send a new one, to {emailAddress} to create a card in your Trello Inbox from that message.","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-card-description-body-2":"From there, move the card to your board or to Trello Planner to get organized. Or, if it's a quick task, you can cross it off your list right from Inbox!","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-card-description-body-3":"Make sure to send from the email address associated with your Trello account! If you want to create a card from a different email address, use the unique email address assigned to your Inbox:","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-card-description-body-4":"For advanced tips, or if you need help troubleshooting, visit our Support center to learn how to [{linkText}]({linkUrl}).","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-card-description-heading":"Turn any email into a Trello card","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-card-description-link":"How to Find Your Private Email Address for Inbox | Trello","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-card-description-link-text":"create cards by email","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-email-body-1":"Don't lose to-dos in your email. Forward any message to Trello and instantly save the task to your Trello Inbox.","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-email-body-2":'Click "Send" to try it out!',"templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-email-description":"Each message becomes a card in your Inbox.","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-email-send":"Send","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-email-subject":"See it, send it, save it for later","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-email-subject-label":"Subject: {subject}","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-email-title":"Forward emails directly to Trello","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-email-to-label":"To: {toAddress}","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-success-description":"The email was saved as a card in your Inbox.","templates.new_user_onboarding.quick-capture-success-title":"Success!","templates.new_user_onboarding.step-1-inbox":"Step 1 of 4: Inbox","templates.new_user_onboarding.step-2-add-to-inbox":"Step 2 of 4: Add cards to your Inbox with apps","templates.new_user_onboarding.step-3-organize":"Step 3 of 4: Organize your cards","templates.new_user_onboarding.step-4-complete":"Step 4 of 4: You finished your first card","templates.new_user_onboarding.this-week-list-title":"This week","templates.new_user_onboarding.today-list-