esolution.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-create-error-1":"This feature requires a workspace.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-create-input-placeholder-1":"For example: I want to cook at home more because I want to eat healthier.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-create-input-placeholder-2":"For example: I want to travel more because it makes me feel inspired.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-create-title":"What's your New Year's resolution?","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-error-context-description":"It looks like the input wasn't something we can work with. Try editing it and we'll give it another go.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-error-context-title":"We couldn't use that resolution","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-error-description":"We couldn't create your board this time. Try again and we'll take another shot.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-error-generic-cancel":"Cancel","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-error-generic-cta":"Try again","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-error-title":"Something went wrong","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-loading-description":"We're shaping your resolution into clear lists, next steps, and ideas to help you hit the ground running in 2026.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-loading-title":"Creating your board...","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-privacy-disclaimer-1":"Your board's visibility will be set to private.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-privacy-disclaimer-2":"Content quality may vary","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.modal-privacy-disclaimer-3":"Powered by AI","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.popup-cta":"Try it","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.popup-description":"Instantly create a personalized New Year's Resolution board, powered by AI, to help you accomplish your goal and stay on track.","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.popup-title":"Turn your New Year's resolution into reality","templates.nyr_26_ai_bb.title":"New Year's Resolution 2026!","templates.open_source_attributions_page.attributions":"Trello Open Source Attributions","templates.open_source_attributions_page.attributions de