ect-subtext":"Focus time suggestions need a connected calendar account to schedule any cards.","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.continue":"Continue","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.default-working-hours":"Only schedule focus time Monday to Friday from 9am to 5pm","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.dialog-title":"Schedule Focus Time","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.go-to-ai-settings":"Go to AI settings","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.proactive-help-label":"More information about proactive scheduling","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.proactive-help-tooltip":"Trello will look at your configured boards overnight and suggest focus times for applicable cards to help you plan your day","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.proactively-schedule-focus-times":"Proactively schedule focus times","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.rule-placeholder":"For example: Always schedule cards with label 'urgent'","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.rule-placeholder-scheduling":"Schedule personal errands after 5pm","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.rule-type-aria-label":"Rule type","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.rule-type-card":"Card","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.rule-type-schedule-preference":"Schedule preference","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.rules-help-description":"These rules help determine when focus times will be scheduled for you.","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.save":"Save","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.save-error-description":"You can update them anytime on your AI settings page.","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.save-error-title":"We couldn't save some of your focus time settings.","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.scheduling-rules-aria-label":"Information about scheduling preference rules","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.scheduling-rules-description":"Specify general rules for when you would like selected cards scheduled.","templates.smart_schedule.onboarding.scheduling-rules-example":"e.g. Code relat